{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10241","headline":"同李郎中净律院梡子树 · 包何","name":"同李郎中净律院梡子树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本梡稀难识，沙门种则生。\n叶殊经写字，子爲佛称名。\n滤水浇新长，燃灯暖更荣。\n亭亭无别意，只是劝修行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}